# ==============================================================================
# VirtualHQ — Supabase Cloud Credentials (Modern Publishable API Keys)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Open Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API Keys
# 2. Copy "Project URL" and your new "Publishable key" (starts with sb_publishable_)
# 3. Create a `.env` file in the project root and add:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key_here

# (Optional: Legacy anon key fallback is also supported)
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
